# arm-sysroot.recipe — how build/webos-oe/arm-sysroot/root is made from the 187 Debian jessie
# armel packages in arm-sysroot-debs.manifest. Applied by
#   build/webos-oe/gen-sysroot-manifest.sh --assemble
# after --fetch (the .debs) and --fetch-device-libs (libpulse.so.0 off a TouchPad).
#
# Derived 2026-10-14 by comparing the sysroot every engine and daemon build since 2026-08-15 used
# against a plain unpack of the same packages (cavekit-device-build.md R11). What it does:
#   rm   Debian's glibc 2.19 runtime, its static/dev libraries, crt*.o and headers, the kernel
#        headers (linux-libc-dev), libgcc_s.so.1 and libstdc++.so.6: the crosstool-NG toolchain
#        brings its own glibc 2.23 and gcc 9.4 runtime, and two of each on the include and link
#        paths break the build.
#   cp   the remaining /lib/arm-linux-gnueabi libraries copied into /usr/lib/arm-linux-gnueabi,
#        where the link step looks.
#   ln   six development symlinks that pointed at /lib/... (absolute, so outside the sysroot)
#        pointed at the copies instead.
#   pulse-headers  PulseAudio 0.9.22's src/pulse/*.h from the third_party/pulseaudio submodule
#        (the device's version, for cubeb_pulse), with version.h generated as its configure would.
#   repo  a file kept in the repository (sysroot-extra/).
#   device  a library copied off the TouchPad (dlopen'd at run time; its ABI is the device's).
#   digest  sha256 over the finished tree, as gen-adapter-deps-manifest.sh's tree_digest: the
#        assembled sysroot must match it, or --assemble fails.
# TSV. Paths are relative to arm-sysroot/root.
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/ld-2.19.so
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/ld-linux.so.3
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libBrokenLocale-2.19.so
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libBrokenLocale.so.1
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libanl-2.19.so
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libanl.so.1
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libc-2.19.so
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libc.so.6
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libcrypt-2.19.so
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libcrypt.so.1
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libdl-2.19.so
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libdl.so.2
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libgcc_s.so.1
rm	lib/arm-linux-gnueabi/libm-2.19.so
